## Validation checklist for Phase 6

### Functional validation
- `continuous_move` executes for expected duration
- `stop` is sent immediately after movement ends
- `stop` failure results in `UNSYNCED` state
- `position_reliability` updates from `UNKNOWN` to `ESTIMATED` only after successful stop
- `manual override` interrupts movement immediately
- `pause_event` stops dwell loops without leaving camera in motion

