## Notes for the project
This phase is the practical hardening layer that makes the controller safe enough for real hardware. It is the bridge between a functioning mock controller and a trusted real-motion system.

The project should maintain the established rule:
- mock mode is for testing and extension
- dry_run remains the default gate for all real hardware commands
- the controller should only auto-move once a movement has been confirmed safe

